      <trans-unit id="CancelCommandConfirmation">
        <source>This requests cancellation of the active Azure operation that includes this resource, or the active Azure deployment for this resource. If the operation includes other Azure resources, they will be canceled too. Azure may continue work that cannot be canceled immediately, and resources already created are not deleted. Do you want to continue?</source>
        <target state="translated">這會要求取消包含此資源的作用中 Azure 作業，或此資源的作用中 Azure 部署。如果作業包含其他 Azure 資源，也會一併取消。Azure 可能會繼續無法立即取消的工作，且不會刪除已建立的資源。是否要繼續？</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="CancelCommandDescription">
        <source>Requests cancellation of the active Azure operation or deployment for this resource.</source>
        <target state="translated">要求取消此資源的作用中 Azure 作業或部署。</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="CancelCommandName">
        <source>Cancel</source>
        <target state="translated">取消</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="CancelCommandSuccess">
        <source>Azure cancellation requested.</source>
        <target state="translated">已要求 Azure 取消。</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ChangeAzureContextCommandConfirmation">
        <source>This updates the Azure context for this AppHost and reprovisions all Azure resources using the values you enter next.</source>
        <target state="translated">這會更新此 AppHost 的 Azure 內容，然後使用您接下來輸入的值重新佈建所有 Azure 資源。</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ChangeAzureContextCommandDescription">
        <source>Updates the Azure tenant, subscription, resource group, or location for this AppHost and reprovisions all Azure resources.</source>
        <target state="translated">更新此 AppHost 的 Azure 租用戶、訂用帳戶、資源群組或位置，然後重新佈建所有 Azure 資源。</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ChangeAzureContextCommandName">
        <source>Change Azure context</source>
        <target state="translated">變更 Azure 內容</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ChangeAzureContextCommandSuccess">
        <source>Azure context updated and resources reprovisioned.</source>
        <target state="translated">Azure 內容已更新，資源已重新佈建。</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ChangeResourceLocationCommandDescription">
        <source>Changes the Azure location for this resource. If Aspire must delete and recreate the existing Azure resource, any data in it may be permanently lost.</source>
        <target state="translated">變更此資源的 Azure 位置。如果 Aspire 必須刪除並重建現有的 Azure 資源，其內的任何資料都可能永久遺失。</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ChangeResourceLocationCommandName">
        <source>Change location</source>
        <target state="translated">變更位置</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ChangeResourceLocationCommandSuccess">
        <source>Azure resource location updated and reprovisioning completed.</source>
        <target state="translated">Azure 資源位置已更新，重新佈建已完成。</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ChangeResourceLocationConfirmDeleteDescription">
        <source>Allow Aspire to delete and recreate the existing Azure resource when changing its location. Any data in the deleted resource may be permanently lost.</source>
        <target state="translated">允許 Aspire 在變更現有 Azure 資源的位置時，刪除並重建該資源。已刪除資源中任何資料都可能永久遺失。</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ChangeResourceLocationConfirmDeleteLabel">
        <source>Allow deletion and possible permanent data loss</source>
        <target state="translated">允許刪除和可能的永久資料遺失</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ChangeResourceLocationDeleteConfirmationRequiredFormat">
        <source>Changing the location of Azure resource '{0}' requires deleting and recreating it. Any data in the deleted resource may be permanently lost. Set the '{1}' command argument to true to continue.</source>
        <target state="translated">變更Azure資源 '{0}' 的位置需要刪除並重新建立。已刪除資源中的任何資料可能會永久遺失。將 '{1}' 命令引數設定為 true 以繼續。</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ChangeResourceLocationKeyVaultUnsupported">
        <source>Azure Key Vault resources cannot change location because soft-deleted vault names remain reserved globally. Use delete, reprovision, or forget state to recover this resource.</source>
        <target state="translated">Azure Key Vault 資源無法變更位置，因為虛刪除的儲存庫名稱會維持全域保留。使用刪除、重新佈建或忘記狀態來復原此資源。</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ChangeResourceLocationPromptMessage">
        <source>Select or enter a new Azure location for '{0}'. If Aspire must delete and recreate the existing Azure resource, any data in it may be permanently lost.</source>
        <target state="translated">選取或輸入 '{0}' 的新 Azure 位置。如果 Aspire 必須刪除並重建現有的 Azure 資源，其內的任何資料都可能永久遺失。</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ChangeResourceLocationPromptTitle">
        <source>Change Azure resource location</source>
        <target state="translated">變更 Azure 資源位置</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
