      <trans-unit id="DeleteAzureResourceCommandConfirmation">
        <source>This cancels the cached Azure deployment, deletes Azure resources targeted by this resource's deployment, purges recoverable Key Vaults so their names can be reused, and clears cached deployment state. Do you want to continue?</source>
        <target state="translated">這會取消快取的 Azure 部署、刪除此資源部署鎖定的 Azure 資源、清除可復原的 Key Vault，以便重複使用其名稱，以及清除快取的部署狀態。要繼續嗎?</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="DeleteAzureResourceCommandDescription">
        <source>Cancels the cached Azure deployment, deletes Azure resources targeted by the deployment, purges recoverable Key Vaults so their names can be reused, and clears cached deployment state for this resource.</source>
        <target state="translated">取消快取的 Azure 部署、刪除部署鎖定的 Azure 資源、清除可復原的 Key Vault，以便重複使用其名稱，以及清除此資源的快取部署狀態。</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="DeleteAzureResourceCommandName">
        <source>Delete Azure resource</source>
        <target state="translated">刪除 Azure 資源</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="DeleteAzureResourceCommandSuccess">
        <source>Azure resources deleted and provisioning state reset.</source>
        <target state="translated">已刪除 Azure 資源並重設佈建狀態。</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="DeleteAzureResourcesCommandConfirmation">
        <source>This deletes the current Azure resource group and every Azure resource inside it for this AppHost, then clears the cached deployment state. Do you want to continue?</source>
        <target state="translated">這會針對此 AppHost 刪除目前的 Azure 資源群組及其內的每個 Azure 資源，然後清除快取的部署狀態。要繼續嗎?</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="DeleteAzureResourcesCommandDescription">
        <source>Deletes the current Azure resource group for this AppHost, clears cached deployment state, and leaves the Azure context intact for reprovisioning.</source>
        <target state="translated">刪除此 AppHost 目前的 Azure 資源群組、清除快取的部署狀態，並保留 Azure 內容以供重新佈建。</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="DeleteAzureResourcesCommandName">
        <source>Delete Azure resources</source>
        <target state="translated">刪除 Azure 資源</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="DeleteAzureResourcesCommandSuccess">
        <source>Azure resources deleted and provisioning state reset.</source>
        <target state="translated">已刪除 Azure 資源並重設佈建狀態。</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="DeleteAzureResourcesRemainingResourcesFormat">
        <source>Resource-group deletion completed. These resources were not deleted: {0}.</source>
        <target state="translated">資源群組刪除作業已完成。下列資源未刪除: {0}。</target>
        <note>{0} is a list of resource names, provider types, and object IDs.</note>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="DeleteAzureResourcesRemainingResourcesWarning">
        <source>The listed resources were not deleted because they exist outside the resource group. Delete them separately using their service's portal or API.</source>
        <target state="translated">下列資源未刪除，因為這些資源位於資源群組之外。請透過各自服務的入口網站或 API 分別刪除。</target>
        <note />
